                                                                                                                                         2nd Floor Suite A, 520–534 King Street (9,800 SF)\n                              Lease Execution Date                                                                                                                                         December 15, 2022                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   June 1, 2021                                                                                                                                                                                           March 15, 2024\n                           Lease Commencement Date                                                                                                                                           January 1, 2023                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   July 1, 2021                                                                                                                                                                                            April 1, 2024\n                             Lease Expiration Date                                                                                                                                         December 31, 2027                                                                                                                                                                                            