.5    No Waste; No Alteration; No Demolition\n     Section 8.6    No Misapplication of Rents, Deposits or Proceeds\n     Section 8.7    Renovation Contract\nARTICLE 9 RENOVATION HOLDBACK AND DISBURSEMENT\nPROVISIONS\n     Section 9.1    The Renovation Holdback\n     Section 9.2    Renovation Budget and Renovation Contract\n     Section 9.3    Conditions to Each Disbursement\n     Section 9.4    Retainage\n     Section 9.5    Substantial Completion Deadline\n     Section 9.6    Cost Overruns; No Obligation to Increase the Loan\n     Section 9.7    Suspension of Disbursements\n", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ci384vzID16m2sYzrU0e1249", "tool_name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/pdfout && pdftotext -layout mortgage-and-security-agreement.pdf msa.txt && echo \\\"=== PAGE 1 ===\\\" && sed -n '1,60p' msa.txt && echo \\\"=== TOC page 2 sample ===\\\" && awk 'BEGIN{p=1} /\\\\f/{p++} p==3' msa.txt | head -40\"}"}
