{"turn": 60, "role": "tool", "result": "==== PAGE 11 ====\n                                   Mortgage and Security Agreement — CHB CRE Loan No. 2025-CHS-0047\n\n\n\nSection 1.2 Rules of Construction. In this Mortgage: (a) the words “include,”\n“includes” and “including” are deemed to be followed by the words “without\nlimitation”; (b) “or” is not exclusive; (c) references to Articles, Sections, Exhibits\nand Schedules are to Articles and Sections of, and Exhibits and Schedules to, this\nMortgage; (d) the singular includes the plural and vice versa, and the masculine,\nfeminine and neuter genders include each other; (e) headings are for convenience\nonly and do not affect interpretation; (f) references to any agreement, instrument\nor statute are to that agreement, instrument or statute as amended, restated,\nsupplemented or replaced from time to time, and to any rules and regulations\npromulgated thereunder; (g) accounting terms not otherwise defined have the\nmeanings given under GAAP; (h) references to “days” mean calendar days unless\nBusiness Days are specified; and (i) if any period expires on a day that is not a\nBusiness Day, the period is extended to the next Business Day.\nThis Mortgage is the result of negotiation between Mortgagor and Mortgagee,\neach represented by counsel, and no rule of construction resolving ambiguities\nagainst the drafting party shall apply.\nSection 1.3 Relationship Among the Loan Documents. This Mortgage is one\nof the Loan Documents and secures the Indebtedness. The Loan Documents are\nintended to be read together, and a default under any Loan Document that is not\ncured within any applicable cure period constitutes an Event of Default under this\nMortgage. If any provision of this Mortgage conflicts with the Note, \n==== PAGE 32 ====\n                                    Mortgage and Security Agreement — CHB CRE Loan No. 2025-CHS-0047\n\n\n\n (c) Periodic Inspection. Mortgagor shall cause the Vapor Barrier to be inspected\n     