  Lot 7 to residential use, any penetration, removal or impairment of the\n      Vapor Barrier not repaired in accordance with Section 7.4, any failure to\n      obtain the inspections or deliver the reports required by Section 7.4(c), any\n      failure to notify SCDHEC or Mortgagee before work affecting the Bay 1 slab,\n      or any amendment, modification or termination of the LUR without\n      Mortgagee’s consent, subject to the cure period in Section 10.2(c);\n (l)   Environmental. Any breach of Section 7.3, or any release of Hazardous\n        Materials at the Property that is not remediated in accordance with\n        Environmental Laws and this Mortgage, or any default under the\n        Environmental Indemnity Agreement;\n (m)   Guaranty. Any default by Guarantor under the Guaranty or the\n       Environmental Indemnity Agreement, or any termination, repudiation or\n       asserted unenforceability of either;\n (n)   Substantial Completion. Failure by Mortgagor to achieve Substantial\n       Completion by the Substantial Completion Deadline, subject to any written\n       extension granted by Mortgagee;\n (o)   Reserves. Failure by Mortgagor to make any deposit to any Reserve Fund, or\n       failure to replenish the Tenant Improvement and Leasi\n", "tool_call_id": "call_00_0gp33fkgwlR4MnqkcFOO8806", "tool_name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cd /workspace && rm -rf /tmp/mo && soffice --headless --convert-to pdf --outdir /tmp/mo output/mortgage-and-security-agreement.docx >/dev/null 2>&1; cd /tmp/mo && pdftotext -layout *.pdf m.txt && python3 -c \\\"\\ntxt=open('m.txt').read(); pages=txt.split('\\\\f')\\nfor i in (11,32,44):\\n    print('==== PAGE %d ===='%i); print(pages[i-1][:1700])\\\"\"}"}
